### def rect        -> [Numeric, Numeric]
### def rectangular -> [Numeric, Numeric]

実部と虚部を配列にして返します。

```ruby title="例"
p Complex(3).rect  # => [3, 0]
p Complex(3.5).rect  # => [3.5, 0]
p Complex(3, 2).rect # => [3, 2]
```

- **SEE** [m:Numeric#rect]

